WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:20.758
Jack woke up early and walked to town.

2
00:00:20.759 --> 00:00:31.713
First he went to the shoemaker's shop.

3
00:00:31.714 --> 00:00:34.300
"Good morning, sir," Jack said.

4
00:00:34.301 --> 00:00:35.955
"I need a job.

5
00:00:35.956 --> 00:00:39.522
Do you have any work for me?"

6
00:00:39.523 --> 00:00:41.982
The shoemaker shook his head.

7
00:00:41.983 --> 00:00:44.880
"I'm sorry, Jack," he said.

8
00:00:44.881 --> 00:01:02.517
"I don't need any help."

9
00:01:02.518 --> 00:01:10.309
Next Jack went to the bakery.

10
00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:12.919
He greeted the baker.

11
00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:16.721
"Do you have any work for me?" he asked.

12
00:01:16.722 --> 00:01:19.088
The baker shook her head.

13
00:01:19.089 --> 00:01:22.214
"Not right now, Jack.

14
00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:28.180
My daughters are helping me."

15
00:01:28.181 --> 00:01:37.698
Jack went from shop to shop.

16
00:01:37.699 --> 00:01:40.460
But he had no luck.

17
00:01:40.461 --> 00:01:45.412
Jack sighed. "This is terrible.

18
00:01:45.413 --> 00:01:49.749
No one needs any help."

19
00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:52.890
Jack began to walk home.

20
00:01:52.891 --> 00:02:05.436
How would he tell Mother the bad news?

21
00:02:05.437 --> 00:02:09.606
"Argh!" He kicked a rock hard.

22
00:02:09.607 --> 00:02:12.343
It bounced down the dirt road.

23
00:02:12.344 --> 00:02:17.453
"Ouch!" a voice called. "Stop kicking rocks!"

24
00:02:17.454 --> 00:02:19.082
Jack looked up.

25
00:02:19.083 --> 00:02:22.957
A young woman stood outside a shabby house.

26
00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:25.712
She was gathering herbs.

27
00:02:25.713 --> 00:02:28.010
"I'm sorry!" Jack said.

28
00:02:28.011 --> 00:02:31.043
"I didn't mean to hurt you.

29
00:02:31.044 --> 00:02:39.526
I was just mad about something."

30
00:02:39.527 --> 00:02:45.062
"It's okay." The young woman smiled at Jack.

31
00:02:45.063 --> 00:02:49.345
Jack smiled back shyly. "My name is Jack."

32
00:02:49.346 --> 00:02:53.636
"I'm Eliza," the young woman said.

33
00:02:53.637 --> 00:03:01.214
"Tell me, Jack, what are you so mad about?"

